%% A write permission at its holder, and the commit outcome it yields (D50, D55, H1-H7).
stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> Held: permit arrives (this incarnation, first copy)
    Held --> Building: base chosen (certain, proposal, or recovery with the phase-1 floor)
    Building --> NothingSent: all conflicted, send_reserve, gate closed, superseded proposal base
    Building --> StaleBase: stale base, not a proposal (step 5)
    Building --> BaseUnreachable: no reachable base records (R133)
    Building --> Gated: proposal base, gate closed, store data stage (V1)
    Gated --> NothingSent: gate closes
    Gated --> Sent: gate opens (H5)
    Building --> Sent: replicate left (sent_acceptable, H7)
    Sent --> Committed: majority observed within validity
    Sent --> Unknown: majority not observed in time, or a failure after the send
    NothingSent --> [*]: done none, commits get ProtoConflictError (retried)
    BaseUnreachable --> [*]: done unknown (O6), ProtoConflictError
    StaleBase --> [*]: done unknown (O6), commits re-queued, no error
    Committed --> [*]: done committed (O3)
    Unknown --> [*]: done unknown (O6), ProtoOutcomeUnknownError
